atelier-lulua-the-scion-of-arland", "storyline": "\"To the future's most promising alchemist, I entrust this Alchemyriddle.\"\n\nThis is a tale of a curry loving girl who lives in Arklys, a small town located on the border of the Arland Republic. Her dream is to live up to the success of her mother by learning to master alchemy.\n\nHer purpose remains unknown until a mysterious book drops from the sky, which unravels a future filled with new knowledge related to the challenges and people she comes across all throughout her discoveries across Arland as she deciphers the keywords from this book.", "summary": "The 4th entry in the Atelier \"Arland\" series, released 10 years after Atelier Rorona's launch date. Learn about the world of Arland in Lulua\u2019s perspective as she deciphers the mysterious \u201cAlchemyriddle\u201d book with no time pressure. New and old fans can enjoy the new Synthesis system that features \"Dual Elemental Attributes\" and \"Awakened Effects\", as well as a Turn-based Battle system inspired by Atelier Lydie & Suelle while introducing combat features such as \u201cInterrupts\u201d and \u201cPrimal Arts\u201d.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/atelier-lulua-the-scion-of-arland", "videos": [{"id": 25323, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "_Zs07j3BCXk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Zs07j3BCXk", "title": "Atelier Lulua: The Scion of Arland New Trailer (with Anime cutscenes) - PS4, Switch, PC", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_Zs07j3BCXk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 25613, "name": "Gameplay video", "video_id": "XKmOMq0addY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XKmOMq0addY", "title": "Atelier Lulua: The Scion of Arland - Gameplay Trailer - Synthesis Part 2 (PS4, Switch, PC)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XKmOMq0addY/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 26852, "name": "Gameplay video", "video_id": "p8azSzG-Fls", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p8azSzG-Fls", "tit